# Repo-wide Docker build context exclusions (Phase 15).
# Keep node_modules/.venv/build outputs out of the build context.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
packages/database/backups
**/*.dump
apps/web/.local-assets
# Never bake secrets into an image (e.g. apps/ai-engine/.env holds provider keys).
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
.git
.github
*.log
coverage
